    answer: "The right choice depends on whether you run one branch or several. Zennly is booking and operations software built in Nepal for spas, beauty parlours, salons, gyms and clinics. It books staff, room and time together, requires manager approval for discounts, records payments by method and gives the owner one daily report across branches."
