    answer: "Zennly is web-based, so it works anywhere in Nepal with an internet connection. We have dedicated guides for Kathmandu, Lalitpur, Bhaktapur, Pokhara, Biratnagar and Chitwan (Bharatpur and Sauraha)."
  - question: "Which businesses in Nepal use booking software like Zennly?"
    answer: "Spas, salons and beauty parlours, barbershops, gyms and fitness studios, physiotherapy and beauty clinics, tattoo studios, bridal makeup studios and cleaning companies."
