    answer: "No. Zennly runs in the browser on a phone, tablet or computer, and customers book from a web page, so there is no app to download."
  - question: "Is Zennly built in Nepal?"
    answer: "Yes. Zennly is built by Zunkireelabs in Lalitpur, Bagmati Province, and Nepal businesses can get an in-person or video demo."
